{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "buildCommand": "cd app && bash vercel-build.sh",
  "outputDirectory": "app/build/web",
  "installCommand": "echo 'Flutter SDK is fetched by app/vercel-build.sh'",
  "framework": null,
  "rewrites": [
    { "source": "/(.*)", "destination": "/index.html" }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "_comment": "Flutter ne hache pas les noms de fichiers sous /assets/. Les marquer immutable pour un an fige les instantanes de donnees dans le navigateur: le code se met a jour, les chiffres non. C'est ce qui affichait un funding p46 et une incertitude 60/100 par-dessus un build recent, avec un prix INDISPONIBLE parce que l'instantane cache datait d'avant l'ajout de market_data.",
      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "canvaskit ne change qu'a une mise a jour du SDK Flutter, mais ses noms ne sont pas haches non plus: une semaine avec revalidation, pas un an immutable.",
      "source": "/canvaskit/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=604800, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "DENY" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/flutter_bootstrap.js",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/flutter.js",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/main.dart.js",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/flutter_service_worker.js",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/index.html",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
